  "description": "“Stay sharp and run properly. Don’t get caught halfway and get devoured.” Even his lips clung deeply. “Hm? And don’t cry after you've been devoured to the bone.” …A forced contract marriage. Chairman Ahn, her longtime benefactor, handed her over to his good-for-nothing youngest son. But he’s utterly impossible to handle. No matter how many times she runs, she ends up trapped again in his suffocating grasp. That man was... her husband.\n\n**Original Webtoon:**     \n[Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=12608657), [Ridibooks](https://ridibooks.com/books/4516006045), [KakaoPage](https://page.kakao.com/content/67285400), [Lezhin](https://www.lezhin.com/ko/comic/contract_night), [MrBlue](https://www.mrblue.com/webtoon/wt_000070893)",
